id=pico-vrchat-adapt
name=Pico VRChat (Steam Frame) sideload helper
version=1.1
versionCode=2
author=wzy
description=Lets the sideloaded Steam Frame build of VRChat (com.vrchat.android) launch and enter VR on rooted PICO 4 (tested on OS 5.13.7): spoofs PICO OS version props into the permissive 5.5 range, flips sideload/signature candidate switches, grants OpenXR system permissions, and optionally freezes OTA / the security verifier. Pair with the xr-profile-alias module for controller support. Requires Magisk + root.
